PaddleOCR-Rust is an independent native-Rust port project. It is not an
official PaddlePaddle or PaddleOCR release and is not affiliated with or
endorsed by PaddlePaddle.

References to PaddleOCR and PaddlePaddle identify the read-only upstream
behavioral reference used for compatibility research. No PaddleOCR source,
model weights, datasets, fonts, dictionaries, or third-party runtime artifacts
are included in this repository at the time of this notice.
